#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`lsm9ds1` --- LSM9DS1 9-axis IMU"
msgstr ":mod:`lsm9ds1` --- LSM9DS1 9-axlig IMU"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the ST LSM9DS1 iNEMO inertial module over I2C. The LSM9DS1 "
"combines a 3-axis accelerometer, 3-axis gyroscope and 3-axis magnetometer in"
" a single package; the accelerometer and gyroscope share an I2C address "
"while the magnetometer responds on a second address. This driver also "
"enables the on-chip 16-deep gyro/accel FIFO so that the most recent samples "
"can be drained efficiently through :meth:`iter_accel_gyro`."
msgstr ""
"Drivrutin för ST:s iNEMO tröghetsmodul LSM9DS1 över I2C. LSM9DS1 kombinerar "
"en 3-axlig accelerometer, ett 3-axligt gyroskop och en 3-axlig magnetometer "
"i ett enda paket; accelerometern och gyroskopet delar en I2C-adress medan "
"magnetometern svarar på en andra adress. Denna drivrutin aktiverar även "
"chipets 16 poster djupa FIFO för gyro/accel så att de senaste samplen kan "
"tömmas effektivt via :meth:`iter_accel_gyro`\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:14
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Exempel::"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:29
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klasser"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:33
msgid ""
"Construct an ``LSM9DS1`` instance, verify the WHO_AM_I registers of both "
"sub-devices, configure all three sensors and enable the accel/gyro FIFO in "
"continuous mode."
msgstr ""
"Skapar en ``LSM9DS1``\\ -instans, verifierar WHO_AM_I-registren för båda "
"delenheterna, konfigurerar alla tre sensorerna och aktiverar FIFO för "
"accel/gyro i kontinuerligt läge."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:37
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:38
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"En konfigurerad :py:class:`machine.I2C`\\ -buss som sensorn är ansluten "
"till."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:40
msgid "``address_imu``"
msgstr "``address_imu``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:41
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device. Defaults to "
"``0x6B``."
msgstr ""
"7-bitars I2C-adress för accelerometer-/gyroskopdelenheten. Är som standard "
"``0x6B``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:44
msgid "``address_magnet``"
msgstr "``address_magnet``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:45
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the magnetometer sub-device. Defaults to ``0x1E``."
msgstr ""
"7-bitars I2C-adress för magnetometerdelenheten. Är som standard ``0x1E``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:48
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:49
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0`` (off), ``14.9``, "
"``59.5``, ``119``, ``238``, ``476`` or ``952``."
msgstr ""
"Gyroskopets utdatahastighet i Hz. Måste vara en av ``0`` (av), ``14.9``\\ , "
"``59.5``\\ , ``119``\\ , ``238``\\ , ``476`` eller ``952``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:52
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:53
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``245``, "
"``500`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Gyroskopets fullskaleområde i grader per sekund. Måste vara en av ``245``\\ "
", ``500`` eller ``2000``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:56
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:57
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Accelerometerns utdatahastighet i Hz. Samma uppsättning värden som "
"``gyro_odr``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:60
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:61
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Accelerometerns fullskaleområde i g. Måste vara en av ``2``\\ , ``4``\\ , "
"``8`` eller ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:64
msgid "``magnet_odr``"
msgstr "``magnet_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:65
msgid ""
"Magnetometer output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.625``, ``1.25``, "
"``2.5``, ``5``, ``10``, ``20``, ``40`` or ``80``."
msgstr ""
"Magnetometerns utdatahastighet i Hz. Måste vara en av ``0.625``\\ , "
"``1.25``\\ , ``2.5``\\ , ``5``\\ , ``10``\\ , ``20``\\ , ``40`` eller "
"``80``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:68
msgid "``magnet_scale``"
msgstr "``magnet_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:69
msgid ""
"Magnetometer full-scale range in gauss. Must be one of ``4``, ``8``, ``12`` "
"or ``16``."
msgstr ""
"Magnetometerns fullskaleområde i gauss. Måste vara en av ``4``\\ , ``8``\\ ,"
" ``12`` eller ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:74
msgid ""
"Write a hard-iron offset vector into the magnetometer's ``OFFSET_REG_*_M`` "
"registers. The offset is given in the same units as :meth:`magnet` returns "
"(gauss); each component is converted to raw LSBs using the configured "
"magnetometer scale before being written."
msgstr ""
"Skriver en hård-järn-offsetvektor in i magnetometerns ``OFFSET_REG_*_M``\\ "
"-register. Offseten anges i samma enheter som :meth:`magnet` returnerar "
"(gauss); varje komponent konverteras till råa LSB med den konfigurerade "
"magnetometerskalan innan den skrivs."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:82
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the "
"accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar enbytevärdet i registret ``WHO_AM_I`` för "
"accelerometer-/gyroskopdelenheten."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:87
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the magnetometer sub-"
"device."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar enbytevärdet i registret ``WHO_AM_I`` för magnetometerdelenheten."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:92
msgid "Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second."
msgstr "Returnerar gyroskopvektorn ``(x, y, z)`` i grader per sekund."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:96
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar accelerationsvektorn ``(x, y, z)`` i enheter av "
"standardtyngdacceleration (1 g = 9,81 m/s²)."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:101
msgid "Return the magnetic-field vector ``(x, y, z)`` in gauss."
msgstr "Returnerar magnetfältsvektorn ``(x, y, z)`` i gauss."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:105
msgid ""
"Generator that yields ``(gyro, accel)`` tuples for every sample currently "
"available in the FIFO and stops once the FIFO is empty. Each component "
"vector has the same units as :meth:`gyro` and :meth:`accel` respectively."
msgstr ""
"Generator som ger ``(gyro, accel)``\\ -tupler för varje sampel som för "
"närvarande är tillgängligt i FIFO:n och stoppar så snart FIFO:n är tom. "
"Varje komponentvektor har samma enheter som :meth:`gyro` respektive "
":meth:`accel`\\ ."
